          { type: "multi", q: "Select all the reasons for planning personal expenditure that appear in the specification.", options: ["To remain solvent", "To counter the effects of inflation", "To avoid bankruptcy", "To pay more interest", "To set financial targets and goals"], answers: [0, 1, 2, 4], explanation: "Paying more interest is a result of poor planning, not a reason to plan." }
